narrative = '<p>Caller works for the National Human Trafficking Hotline. Caller is reporting that she received a call from an anonymous caller saying that 4 month old, Tyawan Stallings Brown Jr. ( AKA Trey Moore, DOB 10/01/2020) was being trafficked through a network of sex traffickers at Johns Hopkins University Hospital. The caller shared that the anonymous caller reported that the child was being passed between security guards at the hospital. The anonymous caller also reported that there is a lead trafficker named Malia (no last name) who lives at 4711 Beaufort Avenue, Baltimore, MD. The child was also reportedly trafficked and abused in a home in Owings Mills, MD (no address information provided). There is no clear information on where the 4 month old resides or with whom. The anonymous caller reported that the child''s mother, Rianna Moore, is deceased and the child''s father is Tyawan Stallings Brown Sr. No other information was reported.</p><p><br></p><p>After searching the CJAM''s system there appears to be a child named Trophy Brown ( DOB: 10/01/2019) connected to parents named Rianna Moore and Tyawn Stalling-Brown from a service case ( case # 3214611) opened in Baltimore City in 02/2020 until 6/2020 where Trophy''s grandmother, Tanya Stallings, requested assistance in getting custody of him. There is a coordinating custody case in MD Judiciary casesearch where Tanya Stallings filed for custody of a child from these named parents.</p><p><br></p><p>MD Judiciary shows a custody case between Tanya Stallings, Rianna Moore, and Tyawn Stallings Brown. No other criminal information was shown in the system. Note that father is 18 and mother is 19 years old and reportedly deceased.</p><p><br></p><p>No SOR</p><p><br></p><p>Tanya Stallings has a CPS-IR case from 1996 ( no information known) and previous In Home services intervention 2012.</p><p>Bio Mother, Rianna Moore, has CPS history as a child in 2007, 2012, and 2013</p><p><br></p><p>THIS REFERRAL WAS RECEIVED DURING AN AFTER HOURS SHIFT AND REVIEWED BY SUPERVISOR NEXT BUSINESS DAY (1/22/21 EL).</p><p>child is also listed as Trofy Stallings-Brown in CIS and Tyawan Stallings-Brown is receiving benefits for him. They are listed as residing at 12009 Tarragon Rd Apt I Reisterstown, MD 21136. They live in the home with Dawn Haden DOB 2/5/70 who reports Tyawan has been in her care since he was 2yo. She also reported having legal care of Rianna Moore, child''s father, who passed on 2/27/2020.</p><p><br></p><p>Information from referral emailed to CACU Sgt Smith who included MSP Cpl Heid.  Per Cpl Heid, MSP received this tip yesterday from Polaris&nbsp;and tried to reach out to the reporting party. Sgt Flory made contact with BPD and Detective Schurman is working this. She will reach out if she needs more help. Apparently the reporting person isn’t answering or returning calls.&nbsp;  </p><p><br></p><p>This referral is being screened out at this time as the allegations do not meet CPS response currently. MSP is handling the concerns and will notify DSS if child maltreatment is identified. </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>'
